  "bodyHash": "fd252c3ce57a2fdd",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8OAKS5q.png\" width=\"472\" height=\"124\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-Only-d9aa6b?style=for-the-badge&logo=condaforge&logoColor=d9aa6b&labelColor=26303d\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Upgraded Core-F16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=FFFFFF&labelColor=1C1C1C\" width=\"239\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.16.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.17.x-Unsupported-red?style=plastic\" alt=\"\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.18.x-Maintenance-yellow?style=plastic\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/1.19.x-Active Development-green?style=plastic\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">请使用 CurseForge 下载链接，请勿重新托管文件。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组可用于任何整合包。（仅限 CurseForge）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;目前暂无 Fabric 版本计划，敬请谅解。<br><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">(29/10/2025)</span></span>本作将不再移植至 1.20 及以上版本，但我正在开发一款替代品。目前无法提供具体发布日期，但我会尽力尽快推出。在新模组中，你将能够升级任意装备，无论是原版还是模组内容。</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">对于 1.20.1 版本，请查看我的新模组：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Upgraded Trims</span></a></span> &amp; <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Upgraded Additional Trims</span></a></span></span><span style=\"color:#f00\">。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">Aether 模组扩展包 </span></strong>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">➜&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Aetherite</a></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f00\"><strong>给一直询问镐斧（Paxel）的玩家 ➜&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Tools</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>Spartan Weaponry 扩展包 ➜&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Spartan Weaponry</a></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f00\"><strong>提供替代材质包&nbsp;➜ <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/upgraded-netherite-alternative\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite : Alternative</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">模组简介</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">为下界合金护甲、马铠、武器和工具添加了具有独特效果的进阶版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">护甲套装效果可设置为需要穿戴 1 至 4 件部件。（默认：4件）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">合成表</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/428/381/ingot.gif\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/428/378/netheriteshield.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/428/379/bow.gif\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/428/380/netheritehorse.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/428/382/armor.gif\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.19 版本：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/488/output_3wvvuj.gif\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/489/output_jbvahu.gif\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/509/output_brmpfn.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/510/output_bmddfq.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"61\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">效果说明</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QBf062x.png\" alt=\"\">Golderite（金辉合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>护甲</em></strong>：使僵尸猪人保持中立，并增加 2 点幸运值。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>马铠</strong></em>：使骑乘者的抢夺等级 +1。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑、斧、弓与弩</strong></em>：对猪灵蛮兵造成的伤害提高 10%，抢夺等级 +1。抢夺 III 或更高时，额外增加 1 级抢夺。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>斧</strong></em>：对猪灵蛮兵造成的伤害提高 10%，精准采集等级 +1。精准采集 III 或更高时，额外增加 1 级精准采集。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>镐与铲</strong></em>：精准采集等级 +1。精准采集 III 或更高时，额外增加 1 级精准采集。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yKYFQiR.png\">Blazerite（炽焰合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲与马铠</strong></em>：免疫火焰伤害，并在熔岩中提升移动速度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑与斧</strong></em>&nbsp;：对燃烧状态的目标伤害提高 4%。火焰附加 II 或更高时，额外提高 3% 伤害加成，并附带自动熔炼效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>弓与弩</strong></em>&nbsp;：对燃烧状态的目标伤害提高 4%。火焰附魔会额外提高 3% 伤害加成，并附带自动熔炼效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>镐与铲</strong></em>：自动熔炼。（配置文件中可受精准采集影响）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift + 右键可切换自动熔炼功能的开关。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HMmiBSy.png\">Enderite（末影合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲</strong></em>&nbsp;：防止坠入虚空（通过传送玩家返回安全位置），并阻止末影人仇恨。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>马铠效果</strong></em>：防止坠入虚空（传送马匹）。但若在未穿戴末影合金护甲的情况下骑乘，玩家不会随马匹一同传送！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑与斧</strong></em>&nbsp;：命中后使目标在 10 秒内无法瞬移，对末影人伤害提高 4%，并将掉落物传送至目标箱子。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>弓、弩、镐与铲</strong></em>&nbsp;：将掉落物传送至目标箱子。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift + 右键可切换掉落物传送功能的开关。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xtzg5dB.png\">Prismarite（海晶合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲与马铠</strong></em>&nbsp;：水下呼吸，并提升水中移动速度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑、斧、弓与弩</strong></em>：对免疫火焰的敌人伤害提高 10%，对末影人伤害提高 10%，并提升水下挖掘速度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <em><strong>镐与铲</strong></em>&nbsp;：提升水下挖掘速度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gqrYNRH.png\">Witherite（凋灵合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲与马铠</strong></em>&nbsp;：免疫凋零效果。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑、斧、弓与弩</strong></em>：命中施加凋零效果，对已受凋零影响的敌人伤害提高 4%。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tfznuoX.png\">Spiderite（蜘蛛合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲与马铠</strong></em>&nbsp;：免疫中毒效果，并可攀爬墙壁。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑、斧、弓与弩</strong></em>：命中施加中毒效果，对已受中毒影响的敌人伤害提高 4%。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/waDwjWr.png\">Phanterite（幻翼合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲</strong></em>：免疫摔落伤害，并增加步行高度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>马铠</strong></em>：免疫摔落伤害。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑、斧、弓与弩</strong></em>：侦测敌人，对幻翼伤害提高 10%，攻击距离增加 2 格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>镐与铲</strong></em>：侦测敌人，攻击距离增加 2 格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift + 右键可切换敌人侦测功能的开关。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/99PMc12.png\">Featherite（羽饰合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲与马铠</strong></em>：减少摔落伤害，可在水面和熔岩上行走。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲</strong></em>：支持二段跳。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>剑、弓与工具</strong></em>：吸引附近的物品。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>弓</strong></em>&nbsp;：施加吸引效果。（吸引附近的生物实体。）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">按住 Shift + 右键可切换物品吸引功能的开关。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/28ivhGM.png\">Corrupterite（腐化合金）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">消耗饱和度和食物值以修复耐久度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲</strong></em>：最大生命值降低 10%。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>武器与工具</strong></em>：每穿戴一件护甲，抢夺、精准采集和伤害均会提升。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SaZgJ6p.png\">Echorite</strong></span> (1.19)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">灵魂绑定。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>护甲</strong></em> ：你的物品在死亡时有50%的概率保留在背包中 & 减少守卫者音波冲击50%的伤害 & 在深暗之域时恢复生命。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>武器：</strong></em> 对守卫者造成的伤害增加20% & 击杀生物时获得经验加成。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>工具</strong></em> ：挖掘矿石时获得经验加成。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>配置</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">客户端</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite-client.toml</code>&nbsp;位于&nbsp;<code>/config</code>&nbsp;文件夹中</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">服务端</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><code>upgradednetherite-server.toml</code>&nbsp;位于&nbsp;<code>/saves/WORLD_NAME/serverconfigs</code></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">将此文件复制到你的&nbsp;<code>/defaultconfigs</code>&nbsp;文件夹，即可将这些配置应用于所有新建的世界。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">专用服务器此文件位于&nbsp;<code>/world/serverconfigs</code></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的其他模组</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20 +</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DDjo2cf.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jTc5hni.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-additional-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oC1EQZw.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-totems\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/W7CebyS.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/n9kZnB2.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"62\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-gear-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/utZxZ4t.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"62\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">旧版</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAwAGmm.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QL8sbmz.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-ultimerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHr3tPZ.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-creativerite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2lTS4p1.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite-aetherite\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g7c0DLT.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"78\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7hyxts1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">语言支持</span></strong></em> :</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>English (en_us) (5.0.0.4)</p>\n<p>Fran&ccedil;ais (fr_fr) (1.10.1)</p>\n<p>Pусский (ru_ru) (1.10.1) (Fr0stmatic &amp; WhiSkaS)</p>\n<p>Espa&ntilde;ol (es_mx) (1.10.1)&nbsp;(hir0shiyt)</p>\n<p>Japanese (ja_jp) (4.2.